{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge Maestro is a combo-driven puzzle-like rogue-like. Merge Emoji themed Tokens together to create more powerful Tokens to defeat waves of enemies. Craft your set with<strong>\u00a0Hundreds</strong> of unique Tokens to create<strong>\u00a0Thousands</strong> of powerful and wacky combinations. No two runs are ever the same in this bite sized rogue-like you can take with you anywhere!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place </strong>Tokens on  on the board and\u00a0<strong>Merge</strong>\u00a0tokens of the same type to make ones of a higher Level. Higher Level Tokens are Stronger!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/49646142dc24cb11b38cd967500776f0.poster.avif?t=1768180353\" width=608 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/49646142dc24cb11b38cd967500776f0.webm?t=1768180353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/49646142dc24cb11b38cd967500776f0.mp4?t=1768180353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose</strong>\u00a0a new Token to add to your set at the end of every wave. There are 100's of Tokens to discover each with unique effects!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/a5fa913cd3221a94813251e6ec63b87e.poster.avif?t=1768180353\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/a5fa913cd3221a94813251e6ec63b87e.webm?t=1768180353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/a5fa913cd3221a94813251e6ec63b87e.mp4?t=1768180353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergize</strong> your build to defeat the ever more challenging enemies that come each wave across multiple difficulties and challenges!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/5dc87c23020165a2f73cef0d2483f6d5.poster.avif?t=1768180353\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/5dc87c23020165a2f73cef0d2483f6d5.webm?t=1768180353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/5dc87c23020165a2f73cef0d2483f6d5.mp4?t=1768180353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain</strong>\u00a0crazy Powers throughout each run, each with game changing, potentially even game breaking effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/6da21d80197091f8868a46c39249bdaa.poster.avif?t=1768180353\" width=608 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/6da21d80197091f8868a46c39249bdaa.webm?t=1768180353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/6da21d80197091f8868a46c39249bdaa.mp4?t=1768180353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul cla